  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform square plate of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is supported with its plane vertical as shown in the figure. Assume the centre of mass is on a horizontal line passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. If the cable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> breaks then just after that the angular acceleration of the plate is<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7ca23d7a-f34a-4540-b1a9-a6026e796fda-image9.jpeg\" />",
