  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The plate will rotate about the hinged point ( point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;) after breaking of the cable&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;for the plate&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>Mb</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;( Moment of inertia about point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>Mb</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>Mb</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
